Iran reconstructs 80% of oil depots damaged in US-Israeli war in record time

The CEO of Iran's National Iranian Oil Engineering and Construction Company (NIOEC) has announced that 80 percent of the oil depots damaged during the 40-day US-Israeli war have been reconstructed, describing the operation as unprecedented in the history of the country's oil industry in terms of both volume and speed of execution.

